:INFO
Art. 16 Prosecution by the cantons
1 The cantons shall prosecute contraventions that they detect within their jurisdiction (Art. 11 para. 1 let. b).
2 and 3...
4 The proceeds of the fine shall go to the cantons.
|

:NOTE
Para. 1 — Amended by No I of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020, in force since 1 Aug. 2023 (AS 2023 337; BBl 2019 5889).
Para. 2 — Repealed by Annex No II 2 of the Fixed Penalties Act of 18 March 2016, with effect from 1 Jan. 2020 (AS 2017 6559, 2019 527; BBl 2015 959).
|

:INFO
Art. 17 Limitation
The right to prosecute and impose penalties for contraventions becomes time-barred after three years.

